# US Retail Sales Analysis

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes US Retail Sales data using Excel, MySQL, and Tableau.

The project covers data cleaning, SQL-based business analysis, KPI creation, and interactive dashboard development.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies Used

- *Microsoft Excel* – Data Cleaning & Validation
- *MySQL Workbench* – Database Creation & SQL Analysis
- *Tableau Public* – Data Visualization & Dashboard Creation
- *GitHub* – Project Documentation & Version Control

## 📊 Project Workflow

Excel Data Cleaning  
↓  
Cleaned CSV  
↓  
MySQL Database  
↓  
SQL Analysis  
↓  
Tableau Visualization  
↓  
Final Dashboards & KPI Cards

## 🔍 Analysis Performed

- Year-wise Sales Analysis
- Monthly Sales Analysis
- Industry-wise Sales Analysis
- Industry-wise Monthly Sales
- Business-Type Analysis
- Seasonality Analysis
- NAICS Code Analysis
- Outlier Analysis
- Automotive Industry Analysis
- Year-over-Year Growth
- Month-over-Month Growth
- YTD Sales Analysis
- Women's vs Men's Clothing Analysis

## 📈 Tableau Dashboards

### Sales Dashboard
- Year-wise Sales Trend
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Industry-wise Total Sales
- Industry-wise Monthly Sales

### KPI Dashboard
- Total Sales
- Average Sales
- Total Records

## 📁 Project Files

- Project_Task.pdf
- Cleaned_data.csv
- Cleaning_Report.xlsx
- SQL Notebook.sql
- tableau dashboard.twbx

## 🎯 Objective

The objective of this project is to transform raw retail sales data into meaningful business insights using data cleaning, SQL analysis, and interactive Tableau dashboards.

